Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.95,0:11:14.85,title2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(430,300)}隧道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.60,0:00:15.61,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}何ページも費やして　つづられた僕らの気分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.76,0:00:22.86,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}どうしてか一行の　空白を埋められない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.92,0:00:30.99,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}押花のしおりはさんで　君と転がす使い捨ての自転車
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.27,0:00:38.58,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}忘れかけのレンガを　積み上げた場所に行こう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.29,0:00:43.82,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}海を見渡す坂を駆けのぼって
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.72,0:00:48.37,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}こわいくらいに青い空と
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.39,0:00:56.12,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}右手にサイダー　左手はずっと君をさがしている
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.82,0:01:03.87,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}そうやって今は僕の方へ　問いつめることもなくて
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.91,0:01:10.78,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}まだ二人はすぐそこに居るのに
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.88,0:01:16.75,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}どうかまた会えますように
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.77,0:01:26.58,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}なんて　どうかしてるみたい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.60,0:00:15.61,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}使用好幾頁 填補了我們的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.76,0:00:22.86,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}卻彌補不了那唯一的一行
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.92,0:00:30.99,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}夾上乾花書籤 和你乘上騎一次就扔的自行車
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.27,0:00:38.58,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}前往用幾乎遺忘的磚頭堆積起來的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.29,0:00:43.82,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}爬上望得見海的小坡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.72,0:00:48.37,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}頭上是湛藍的天空
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.39,0:00:56.12,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}右手是碳酸飲料 左手一直在尋求著你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.82,0:01:03.87,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}現在呢 你也不會再追問我什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.91,0:01:10.78,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}兩個人明明還在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.88,0:01:16.75,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}而我卻祈願能再次相遇
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.77,0:01:26.58,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}可能是我的錯覺吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.30,0:20:58.13,edjp2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}君と夏の終わり　将来の夢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.22,0:21:01.23,edjp2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}大きな希望　忘れない
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.35,0:21:07.94,edjp2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}10年後の8月　また出会えるのを　信じて
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.69,0:21:16.02,edjp2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}最高の思い出を…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.82,0:21:31.91,edjp2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}出会いは　ふっとした　瞬間
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.19,0:21:35.52,edjp2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}帰り道の交差点で
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.71,0:21:41.32,edjp2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}声をかけてくれたね「一緒に帰ろう」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.17,0:21:47.85,edjp2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}あぁ　花火が夜空　きれいに咲いて
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.97,0:21:50.00,edjp2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}ちょっとセツナク
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.27,0:21:56.67,edjp2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}あぁ　風が時間とともに　流れる
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.91,0:22:04.08,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}嬉しくって　楽しくって　冒険も　いろいろしたね
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.21,0:22:11.07,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}二人の　秘密の　基地の中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.21,0:22:15.05,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}君と夏の終わり　将来の夢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.15,0:22:18.25,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}大きな希望を忘れない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.37,0:22:25.35,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}10年後の8月　また出会えるのを　信じて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.54,0:22:27.40,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}君が最後まで
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.44,0:22:32.58,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}心から「ありがとう」叫んでたこと　知ってたよ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.68,0:22:36.32,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}涙をこらえて　笑顔でさようなら
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.33,0:22:39.58,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}せつないよね
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.02,0:22:48.48,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\be5}最高の思い出を…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.30,0:20:58.13,edcn2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}不會忘記和你度過的夏天 將來的夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.22,0:21:01.23,edcn2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}和巨大的希望
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.35,0:21:07.94,edcn2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}相信著十年後的八月還能與你再會
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.69,0:21:16.02,edcn2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}懷著最美好的回憶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.82,0:21:31.91,edcn2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}邂逅是瞬間的巧合
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.19,0:21:35.52,edcn2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}在回家的路口
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.71,0:21:41.32,edcn2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}你對我說「一起回去吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.17,0:21:47.85,edcn2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}啊 煙花在夜空裡絢麗地綻放
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.97,0:21:50.00,edcn2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}有些傷感
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.27,0:21:56.67,edcn2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}啊 風隨著時間一起流動
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.91,0:22:04.08,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}開心的 愉快的冒險也經歷過很多次
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.21,0:22:11.07,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}在兩個人的秘密基地裡
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.21,0:22:15.05,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}不會忘記和你度過的夏天 將來的夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.15,0:22:18.25,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}和巨大的希望
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.37,0:22:25.35,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}相信著十年後的八月還能與你再會
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.54,0:22:27.40,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}我知道你自始至終
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.44,0:22:32.58,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}都在心裡喊「謝謝」
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.68,0:22:36.32,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}強忍淚水 笑著說再見
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.33,0:22:39.58,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}有些傷感吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.02,0:22:48.48,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\be5}懷著最美好的回憶
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.17,0:01:35.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心啊  仁太
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.35,0:01:38.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宿海
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.52,0:01:40.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒關係！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.88,0:01:50.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪集  你那連衣裙…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.96,0:01:54.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和芽間穿的很像
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.02,0:01:59.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為…為什麼這身打扮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.40,0:02:04.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個  沒事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.01,0:02:09.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看我像沒事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.08,0:02:17.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  仔細看清楚！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.28,0:02:19.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  雪集
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.96,0:02:23.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託了  不要管
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.63,0:02:25.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎  但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.77,0:02:28.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是機會  錯過了的話
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.14,0:02:30.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定會…再也…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.29,0:02:32.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鶴子？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.77,0:02:42.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  看起來像芽間嗎  你能看見芽間吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.53,0:02:45.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看起來像芽間嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.71,0:02:46.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪集…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.23,0:02:47.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能看見嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.90,0:02:54.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的錯啊  那天芽間的死  是我的錯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.82,0:02:59.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說什麼呢  不是你的錯  說了是我…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.49,0:03:01.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我說是我的錯！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.06,0:03:05.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒有對芽間那麼說的話  芽間就不會死
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.43,0:03:08.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我害死了芽間的！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.08,0:03:15.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假如芽間出現  應該出現在我面前
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.35,0:03:21.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管變鬼還是詛咒…都應在我面前！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.33,0:03:32.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是芽間沒有出現…在我面前
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.37,0:03:35.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪集…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.38,0:03:40.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以芽間已經不在了  哪裡都不在！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.66,0:03:46.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.12,0:03:57.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間說她在這兒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.41,0:04:02.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你…還在這麼說…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.99,0:04:12.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間對雪集說「髮夾  謝謝了  對不起」
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.79,0:04:17.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那…那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.62,0:04:20.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然不太明白  那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.44,0:04:23.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪集？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.21,0:04:33.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滿意了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.17,0:04:39.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  就讓他這麼走了？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.88,0:04:43.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好癢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.83,0:04:48.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那大家辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.46,0:04:51.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你…知道的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.49,0:04:56.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是隱約覺得
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.74,0:05:01.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為挺早之前他就讓我放學後陪他了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.96,0:05:06.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裝作給不存在的女朋友挑選禮物
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.31,0:05:13.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女生穿的…白色的繫著小蝴蝶結的連衣裙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.07,0:05:17.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那樣就好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.43,0:05:21.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  膿還是擠乾淨為好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.03,0:05:25.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是那傢伙爛到根了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.00,0:05:29.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把膿擠乾淨了估計就不剩什麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.16,0:05:32.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.15,0:05:44.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「髮夾  謝謝了  對不起」
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.41,0:05:56.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.05,0:06:01.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  仁太…  仁太！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.71,0:06:04.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  等等啊芽間
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.38,0:06:07.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼…等不了…仁太他…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.00,0:06:08.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那種傢伙隨他去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.66,0:06:16.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間不是什麼醜女
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.30,0:06:17.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.63,0:06:20.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個給你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.36,0:06:24.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我覺得這個很襯你…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.66,0:06:28.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我最喜歡的芽間！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.12,0:06:39.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.07,0:06:47.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁太要跑了  芽間要去追他  待會兒見
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.55,0:06:50.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.59,0:07:33.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴著眼鏡看起來好像很一般
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.96,0:07:38.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看不清了呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.67,0:07:44.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  芽…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.14,0:07:52.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽…間
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.06,0:07:59.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個…  你要吃點什麼嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.52,0:08:03.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯…  小健拉麵
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.15,0:08:05.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,家裡沒有呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.31,0:08:08.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且那貨最近也不太能看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.86,0:08:11.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那吃什麼呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.01,0:08:13.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.69,0:08:15.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去買
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.73,0:08:19.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用特意去了  吃家裡有的東西就行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.60,0:08:22.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁太？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.49,0:08:27.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間死了  但是在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.33,0:08:30.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是在雪集身邊  而是在我身邊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.13,0:08:36.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,管她是幽靈還是幻想還是其它  我一直這麼想
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.87,0:08:41.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  我那是逃避了思考
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.91,0:08:49.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和大家在一起很開心  和仁太一起很開心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.16,0:08:55.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「所以不用認真去想也沒關係」我隱約這麼想
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.01,0:09:01.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間為什麼在這裡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.59,0:09:05.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太受人寵愛了  你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.51,0:09:33.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小健拉麵沒賣了所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.39,0:09:36.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以就買了這麼一大堆？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.26,0:09:38.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.68,0:09:46.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了趕緊坐下來…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.52,0:09:48.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁太  我有話要說
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.71,0:09:54.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有話說…  不說這個  脆脆君要化了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.49,0:09:57.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請實現芽間的願望
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.07,0:10:01.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在還說這個幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.86,0:10:07.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也在盡我所能做著呢  各種各樣的事…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.46,0:10:07.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.96,0:10:12.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然沒有像雪集那樣深陷泥潭
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.44,0:10:16.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  我也盡我…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.57,0:10:17.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.67,0:10:27.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是有自己的事要忙的啊  沒時間一直管你的事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.33,0:10:28.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁太…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.07,0:10:30.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.65,0:10:34.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天也真累…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.27,0:10:36.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  這是要幹什麼  開Party嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.81,0:10:41.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦哦  脆脆君好可愛！  我來一根可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.49,0:10:44.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  不可愛了…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.14,0:10:46.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.62,0:10:52.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也盡我…  有什麼可忙的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.57,0:10:59.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃飯  上網  睡覺  玩遊戲  睡覺  吃飯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.60,0:11:01.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是以上的反覆而已…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.00,0:11:03.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然而…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.91,0:11:09.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然而…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.92,0:11:20.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後 回家的時候就這樣坐電車
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.75,0:11:23.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他下班好像是7點左右
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.30,0:11:25.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之後…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.69,0:11:31.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  鳴子你能來真好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.61,0:11:35.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經把鳴子算上了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.39,0:11:39.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,簡訊裡被拒絕了當時真不知如何是好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.07,0:11:43.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對哦  差點被遼君罵了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.39,0:11:44.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和遼沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.95,0:11:46.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個…我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.63,0:11:51.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是鳴子最近真的有點不給面子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.48,0:11:54.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們還說不要和你做朋友了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.78,0:11:57.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的春菜  你玩笑開過頭了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.71,0:11:58.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吧  鳴子？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.58,0:12:02.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,When  we  talk  about  intelligence,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.61,0:12:06.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,we  do  not  mean  the  ability  to  get  a  good  scoreon  a  certain  kind  of  test,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.17,0:12:09.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,or  even  the  ability  to  do  well  in  school,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.66,0:12:10.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,these  are  at  best  only...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.45,0:12:24.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  下一班要30分鐘以後了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.96,0:12:38.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和平常一樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.80,0:12:43.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正因為太平常所以反而覺得詭異
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.69,0:12:45.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你想讓我怎麼做
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.79,0:12:49.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想讓我罵你「女裝男」嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.56,0:12:55.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  那樣我可能更加舒服點
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.37,0:12:59.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可不可以請你不要為了平衡自尊心隨意使喚我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.08,0:13:05.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多虧了你  我才能想開很多事  多謝了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.17,0:13:15.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後他在郵件裡說「我喜歡你」什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.33,0:13:17.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是個現實充啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.54,0:13:24.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特地坐電車跑到外面來
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.12,0:13:26.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿著很大的購物袋
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.95,0:13:29.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是要換衣服吧  和你一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.98,0:13:34.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概不靠衣裝什麼的變個身  就堅持不住了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.80,0:13:35.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在各方面
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.62,0:13:52.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唱的真棒  好厲害  好厲害  好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.12,0:13:56.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一首  小遼來唱  快點唱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.44,0:13:58.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要發出這麼淫蕩的聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.62,0:14:02.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的  小遼  不管是什麼歌  快點啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.06,0:14:03.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開心嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.65,0:14:07.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看上去有點勉強嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.13,0:14:09.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才沒有勉強
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.00,0:14:13.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  我們2個先溜吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.90,0:14:17.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思  我和鳴子先走一步了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.88,0:14:20.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.48,0:14:25.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鳴子看上去身體不舒服  我明天也要早起
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.50,0:14:26.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得起來看海賊王
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.08,0:14:28.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海賊王是後天吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.92,0:14:29.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.77,0:14:30.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們太狡猾了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.83,0:14:34.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鳴子  之後要告訴我們發生了什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.87,0:14:38.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.42,0:14:40.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.26,0:14:45.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎  那  那個
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.75,0:14:48.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,車站  是這裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.37,0:14:54.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說是一起到車站去的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.26,0:14:59.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,討厭啊  先走一步肯定不是指那個吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.29,0:15:02.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且  我真的有點喝多了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.98,0:15:04.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想稍微休息一下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.09,0:15:05.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒開玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.11,0:15:09.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我  但是我真的身體不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.15,0:15:11.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以說稍微休息下就好了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.31,0:15:12.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,休息什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.21,0:15:14.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了  海賊王沒關係嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.09,0:15:16.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海賊王是後天呀
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.99,0:15:20.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊？  不是你自己說的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.71,0:15:22.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你裝什麼裝啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.80,0:15:26.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正你已經是漆黑了的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.26,0:15:28.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.09,0:15:32.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,討厭  討厭  住手  不要碰我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.19,0:15:33.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.50,0:15:35.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「好  好」你個頭啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.10,0:15:40.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放手  混蛋  快放手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.17,0:15:43.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀  安城？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.11,0:15:46.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我正好在和宿海他們玩呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.55,0:15:49.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要不要一起來？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.74,0:15:51.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是什麼傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.76,0:15:54.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  大夥  這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.66,0:15:58.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,切  啊啊  這演的是哪齣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.23,0:16:14.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救下被男人糾纏的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.75,0:16:19.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我人生中幹的最糗的一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.63,0:16:21.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那算是救我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.81,0:16:23.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不應該是先揍他一拳然後把我拉過來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.50,0:16:25.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然我帥氣聰明
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.39,0:16:28.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惜力氣不夠
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.03,0:16:29.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這算什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.44,0:16:33.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話說回來你還真悲劇啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.93,0:16:37.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不想被你說呢  這個女裝男
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.99,0:16:41.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  抱  抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.43,0:16:45.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然有人這麼說才能讓我輕鬆點啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.37,0:16:47.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是處女嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.79,0:16:54.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有  有  有有有  有什麼問題嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.30,0:16:56.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不要和我交往看看
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.25,0:17:04.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  你  你不是喜歡芽間的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.41,0:17:05.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘛  確實如此
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.69,0:17:07.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我  我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.29,0:17:11.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行  這種事不行
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.66,0:17:12.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.64,0:17:13.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為宿海嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.77,0:17:16.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那種傢伙哪裡好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.60,0:17:18.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說哪裡好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.45,0:17:20.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要擅自下結論啊  誰說過喜歡他了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.18,0:17:24.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為他是大家的老大  頭腦好  運動也棒？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.66,0:17:27.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這都是過去式了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.58,0:17:29.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話  話是這麼說沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.01,0:17:31.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他也有意外溫柔的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.37,0:17:35.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近的話如果頭髮再弄弄好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.50,0:17:38.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我覺得和Hey!say!JUMP的小山也有點像
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.14,0:17:38.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.29,0:17:47.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道是不是喜歡他
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.58,0:17:52.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是對宿海比較在意
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.05,0:17:53.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在意？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.05,0:18:04.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間死了  阿姨也死了  感覺很難和宿海搭上話
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.41,0:18:09.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能進一個學校  我實際上還有點開心的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.06,0:18:14.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是宿海忘記不了芽間的事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.11,0:18:19.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也忘記不了不能忘記芽間的宿海
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.44,0:18:22.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.36,0:18:26.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪集你剛才提到宿海的名字了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.38,0:18:28.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說「一起在玩」
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.68,0:18:39.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「特急即將通過  請稍等片刻」
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.33,0:18:44.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們被留下來了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.10,0:19:01.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好嘞
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.46,0:19:07.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,砰砰砰叮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.46,0:19:07.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18}（一休在思考時的背景音效）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.04,0:19:11.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.49,0:19:19.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼你會在我們家吃晚飯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.59,0:19:21.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是帶山菜來了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.75,0:19:24.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天婦羅果然好吃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.72,0:19:28.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噗噗吃得很津津有味呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.50,0:19:30.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鼻子上弄髒了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.74,0:19:34.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了  芽間在嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.64,0:19:36.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在  我在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.78,0:19:38.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間也吃點天婦羅吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.20,0:19:44.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的相信芽間的存在嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.86,0:19:47.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之前我不已經說過了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.69,0:19:48.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.52,0:19:52.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我又重新思考過了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.16,0:19:57.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然不是很明白  但芽間出現在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.90,0:19:59.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概不是一件好事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.97,0:20:02.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是沒法成佛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.98,0:20:05.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才會在這裡的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.14,0:20:07.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成佛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.08,0:20:14.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道啊  這種  這種事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.65,0:20:15.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁太？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.29,0:20:16.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.24,0:20:18.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間在那裡嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.76,0:20:20.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  那個
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.29,0:20:21.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好嘞
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.83,0:20:27.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  芽間  你能給一點提示嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.23,0:20:30.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會砰砰砰叮的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.75,0:20:33.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有願望要實現吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.17,0:20:36.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  也稍微依靠一下我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.98,0:20:40.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想讓你成佛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.30,0:20:41.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  久川
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.87,0:20:44.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  芽間  告訴我  求求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.49,0:20:47.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要光是仁太
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.29,0:20:50.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也在我面前出現吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.01,0:20:52.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行嗎  喂
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.74,0:20:53.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.90,0:21:00.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間也非常想和大家說話啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.53,0:21:05.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.21,0:21:08.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs19}喂  芽間  大家一起來想辦法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.56,0:21:12.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,願望什麼的  成佛什麼的  這種事我也不知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.81,0:21:13.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  沒關係吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.25,0:21:16.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託你了  大家一起來想主意吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.42,0:21:17.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.40,0:21:19.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼一來芽間也…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.57,0:21:20.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噗噗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.54,0:21:27.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能不要這樣了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.73,0:21:35.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託你了  不要再這樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.31,0:21:44.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.04,0:21:54.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道啊
